<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38375" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Prīvernum</span></b> , i,
		n., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				very ancient town of Latium</i>, now <i>ruins near
				Piperno</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 8, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">8, 20</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Verg. A.
				11, 540</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Val. Max. 6, 2, 1</span></i>.
			—Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Prīvernas</span></b> ,
				ātis, adj., <i>of</i> or <i>belonging to Privernum</i>, <i>Privernian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fundus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. de Or. 2, 55, 224</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. Clu. 51, 141</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ager,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Agr. 2, 25, 66</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Liv. 7, 16</span></i>. de senatu Privernate ita
			decretum, <i><span class="en">id. 8, 20</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bellum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 8,
					19</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in Privernati,</span>”
				<i>in the territory of Privernum</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Clu. 51, 141</span></i>
			.—In plur.: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Prīvernātes</span></b> ,
				ĭum, m., <i>the inhabitants of Privernum</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 7,
			15</span></i>; <i><span class="en">8, 1</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Privernatium causā,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 8,
					21</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vina Privernatia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					14, 6, 8, § 65</span></i>
			 Sill.</div>
